Arpa/Milnet readers of net.sources who need files that have been
posted to net.sources should use anonymous FTP to SIMTEL20 to
get PD:<UNIX>UNIX.CRCLST.  This is a frequently-updated list of
all files available in our Unix collection.  We archive almost
everything that is posted to net.sources and mod.sources.  Please
check there before asking someone to netmail or repost files you
missed.  Sue Tabron <TABRON@SIMTEL20.ARPA> is the Administrator
of this collection, in case you have any questions.

